">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" class=\"ad-spinner\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\">\n<circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\" opacity=\".25\"/>\n<path d=\"M21 12a9 9 0 0 0-9-9\"/>\n</svg>\n<span class=\"ad-slot__spinner-text\">Ad loading…</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ad-slot__content\">\n<template class=\"ad-variant\" data-device=\"desktop\"><div class=\"gwill-ad-banner\"><img src=\"%BASE%/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/gwill-ad-leaderboard-728x90-1.jpg\" alt=\"Advertisement\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"728\" height=\"90\"></div></template>\n<template class=\"ad-variant\" data-device=\"tablet\"><div class=\"gwill-ad-banner\"><img src=\"%BASE%/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/gwill-ad-leaderboard-728x90-1.jpg\" alt=\"Advertisement\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"728\" height=\"90\"></div></template>\n<template class=\"ad-variant\" data-device=\"mobile\"><div class=\"gwill-ad-banner\"><img src=\"%BASE%/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/gwill-ad-leaderboard-320x100-1.jpg\" alt=\"Advertisement\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"320\" height=\"100\"></div></template>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- ═══ 3. tool behaviour (config explainer) ═══ -->\n<div id=\"cfx\" style=\"max-width:var(--content-w)\">\n<div class=\"cfx-wrap\">\n<section class=\"cfx-card\">\n<div class=\"cfx-sec\"><span class=\"cfx-sdot\"></span><h2>PASTE A CONFIG</h2><span class=\"cfx-line\"></span></div>\n<div class=\"cfx-toolbar\">\n<span class=\"cfx-typebadge\" id=\"cfx-type\" hidden>Detected: <span class=\"cfx-b\" id=\"cfx-typename\"></span> <span id=\"cfx-typehint\" style=\"font-size:11px;color:var(--dim)\"></span></span>\n<div class=\"cfx-seg\" role=\"tablist\">\n<button id=\"cfx-auto\" class=\"cfx-on\">Auto</button>\n<button id=\"cfx-apache\">.htaccess</button>\n<button id=\"cfx-nginx\">Nginx</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<textarea id=\"cfx-inp\" spellcheck=\"false\" placeholder=\"# paste an .htaccess or nginx server block here...\"></textarea>\n<div class=\"cfx-btnrow\">\n<button class=\"cfx-btn cfx-primary\" id=\"cfx-go\">Explain</button>\n<label class=\"cfx-filelabel\" for=\"cfx-file\">Open file</label>\n<input type=\"file\" id=\"cfx-file\" class=\"cfx-fileinput\" accept=\".htaccess,.conf,.txt,text/plain\">\n<span class=\"cfx-filemsg\" id=\"cfx-filemsg\"></span>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"cfx-card\" id=\"cfx-results\" hidden>\n<div class=\"cfx-sec\"><span class=\"cfx-sdot\"></span><h2>WHAT THIS CONFIG IS DOING</h2><span class=\"cfx-line\"></span></div>\n<div class=\"cfx-summary\" id=\"cfx-summary\"></div>\n<div class=\"cfx-sec\"><span class=\"cfx-sdot\"></span><h2>RED FLAGS</h2><span class=\"cfx-line\"></span></div>\n<div id=\"cfx-flags\"></div>\n<div class=\"cfx-sec\"><span class=\"cfx-sdot\"></span><h2>LINE BY LINE</h2><span class=\"cfx-line\"></span><span class=\"cfx-hint\">tap any line for the full explanation</span></div>\n<div class=\"cfx-search\"><input type=\"search\" id=\"cfx-filter\" placeholder=\"filter - e.g. cache, hotlink, https\"></div>\n<div id=\"cfx-lines\"></div>\n<div class=\"cfx-btnrow\">\n<button class=\"cfx-btn cfx-ghost\" id=\"cfx-copy\">Copy explanation</button>\n<button class=\"cfx-btn cfx-primary\" id=\"cfx-dl\">Download .md</button>\n</div>\n<p class=\"cfx-note\"><b>Honest scope:</b> this is a static reader - it explains common directives accurately but does not run the config or start a server. Lines it cannot identify get flagged as &quot;not recognised - likely fine but check the docs&quot;; it will not invent an explanation for something it does not know.</p>\n</section>\n<footer class=\"cfx-foot\">no server · config never leaves this device · the reverse generator - reads configs back, one line at a time</footer>\n<!-- ═══ related tools (6-point law #3) ═══ -->\n<section class=\"cfx-related\" aria-labelledby=\"cfx-related-h\">\n<h2 id=\"cfx-related-h\" class=\"cfx-related-h\">&gt;_ Related tools</h2>\n<div class=\"cfx-related-grid\">\n<a class=\"cfx-rel-card\" href=\"%BASE%/tools/nginx-config-generator/\">\n<span class=\"cfx-rel-name\">Nginx Config Generator</span>\n<span class=\"cfx-rel-desc\">Generate the server block this tool explains.</span>\n</a>\n<a class=\"cfx-rel-card\" href=\"%BASE%/tools/htaccess-generator/\">\n<span class=\"cfx-rel-name\">.htaccess Generator</span>\n<span class=\"cfx-rel-desc\">Build Apache rules and see them explained here.</span>\n</a>\n<a class=\"cfx-rel-card\" href=\"%BASE%/tools/htaccess-nginx-converter/\">\n<span class=\"cfx-rel-name\">.htaccess ⇄ Nginx Converter</span>\n<span class=\"cfx-rel-desc\">Translate rules between the two engines.</span>\n</a>\n<a class=\"cfx-rel-card\" href=\"%BASE%/tools/debug-log-analyzer/\">\n<span class=\"cfx-rel-name\">Debug Log Analyzer</span>\n<span class=\"cfx-rel-desc\">Paste a debug.log and see what actually failed.</span>\n</a>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- ═══ visible FAQ (6-point law #2 - mirrors the FAQPage schema byte-exact) ═══ -->\n<section class=\"cfx-faq\" aria-labelledby=\"cfx-faq-h\">\n<h2 id=\"cfx-faq-h\" class=\"cfx-faq-h\">&gt;_ FAQ</h2>\n<details class=\"cfx-faq-item\">\n<summary>What does this .htaccess rewrite rule actually do?</summary>\n<p>Paste the config into the explainer and it reads each RewriteRule, RewriteCond, Header, and FilesMatch directive back in plain English - e.g. &quot;forces HTTPS on everything&quot;, &quot;blocks directory listing&quot;, &quot;protects wp-config.php&quot;, plus a red-flags list for security-critical directives.</p>\n</details>\n<details class=\"cfx-faq-item\">\n<summary>Can I tell if a config is Apache or Nginx?</summary>\n<p>Yes - the tool auto-detects the dialect (RewriteEngine/.htaccess markers vs server{}/location{} blocks) and explains each directive against the correct knowledge base, or you can force .htaccess or Nginx.</p>\n</details>\n<details class=\"cfx-faq-item\">\n<summary>Does my config get uploaded anywhere?</summary>\n<p>No - the explainer reads your config entirely in your browser with JavaScript. Nothing is uploaded, logged, or stored; close the tab and it is gone.</p>\n</details>\n</section>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ad-slot ad-slot--in-content\">\n<div class=\"ad-slot__spinner\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" class=\"ad-spinner\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\">\n<circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\" opacity=\".25\"/>\n<path d=\"M21 12a9 9 0 0 0-9-9\"/>\n</svg>\n<span class=\"ad-slot__spinner-text\">Ad loading…</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ad-slot__content\">\n<template class=\"ad-variant\" data-device=\"desktop\"><div class=\"gwill-ad-banner\"><img src=\"%BASE%/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/gwill-ad-incontent-336x280-1.jpg\" alt=\"Advertisement\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"336\" height=\"280\"></div></template>\n<template class=\"ad-variant\" data-device=\"tablet\"><div class=\"gwill-ad-banner\"><img src=\"%BASE%/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/gwill-ad-incontent-336x280-1.jpg\" alt=\"Advertisement\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"336\" height=\"280\"></div></template>\n<template class=\"ad-variant\" data-device=\"mobile\"><div class=\"gwill-ad-banner\"><img src=\"%BASE%/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/gwill-ad-incontent-300x250-1.jpg\" alt=\"Advertisement\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"300\" height=\"250\"></div></template>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<div class=\"ad-slot ad-slot--before-footer\">\n<div class=\"ad-slot__spinner\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" class=\"ad-spinner\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\">\n<circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\" opacity=\".25\"/>\n<path d=\"M21 12a9 9 0 0 0-9-9\"/>\n</svg>\n<span class=\"ad-slot__spinner-text\">Ad loading…</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ad-slot__content\">\n<template class=\"ad-variant\" data-device=\"desktop\"><di